\f1\fs22 Tony\'92s afternoon jobs were drudgery, and gave him no distraction from Sarah or the embarrassment of running over a body in the business district where dozens of cameras watched every warm body. He was sure there\'92d be hundreds of memes of him by now on Cloq Toq deriding his buffoonery. \
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>At home, Tony waved his armpit at the front lock and pushed the door open. As soon as he was closeted in the tiny hall, he kicked his shoes off. The still air told him he was alone. He sighed with relief.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>He and Andrea had been fighting for weeks. Not just raised voices, not only verbal abuse, but physical assaults, such as knees to the groin (
\f2\i her
\f1\i0  knee to 
